---
// Quiz figure for the color post, Uxq05: white label on two pure hues at the same HSL lightness.
---
<div class="qfig-uxq05whiteonhue">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 150" role="img" aria-label="White Save label on a pure yellow chip hsl(60, 100%, 50%) and on a pure blue chip hsl(240, 100%, 50%).">
<rect x="20" y="20" width="260" height="70" rx="10" fill="#FFFF00" />
<text x="150" y="62" class="w" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:20px"><tspan data-lang-en>Save changes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu thay đổi</tspan></text>
<text x="150" y="116" class="m" text-anchor="middle">hsl(60, 100%, 50%)</text>
<rect x="320" y="20" width="260" height="70" rx="10" fill="#0000FF" />
<text x="450" y="62" class="w" text-anchor="middle" style="font-size:20px"><tspan data-lang-en>Save changes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu thay đổi</tspan></text>
<text x="450" y="116" class="m" text-anchor="middle">hsl(240, 100%, 50%)</text>
<text x="300" y="142" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Both claim 50% lightness</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cả hai đều ghi độ sáng 50%</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq05whiteonhue { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq05whiteonhue svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq05whiteonhue text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-uxq05whiteonhue .h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq05whiteonhue .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .qfig-uxq05whiteonhue .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq05whiteonhue .w { fill: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
</style>
